CONTROLS
======================================================================================================================
  [PASS] C1 exponential disc: peak at R/Rd in [2.1, 2.3] with v^2max Rd/(GM) = 0.3877 +- 0.001; Keplerian at 50 Rd within 0.5%
         peak R/Rd = 2.1500, v^2max Rd/GM = 0.38705; v^2 R/GM at 50 Rd = 1.00181
  [PASS] C2 kernel round trip nu(y*(D)) = D to 1e-9 for D in [1.06, 100] (nu_mono and nu_RAR)
